# Simulation inputs are local and synthetic; no live navigation or weather feed is used.
# The browser basemap and CesiumJS assets still load from external providers.
# For a non-local UI origin, explicitly list the trusted origin(s), comma-separated.
# NAVRUNA_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:8080,http://localhost:8080
# For a non-local API hostname, explicitly list the trusted hostnames, comma-separated.
# NAVRUNA_ALLOWED_HOSTS=127.0.0.1,localhost
